{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Sandbox is a multiplayer VR modding platform powered by Unreal Engine 5. With advanced physics, detailed VR interactions and the creativity of our modding community, anything is possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/a89526efb641d71f424d6e20bb20db38.poster.avif?t=1773956264\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/a89526efb641d71f424d6e20bb20db38.webm?t=1773956264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/a89526efb641d71f424d6e20bb20db38.mp4?t=1773956264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced Physics Sandbox</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced physics based interactions. Everything in-game behaves realistically, in single-player and multiplayer!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/3649457fcd1be076f58e25e3e1acf22a.poster.avif?t=1773956264\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/3649457fcd1be076f58e25e3e1acf22a.webm?t=1773956264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/3649457fcd1be076f58e25e3e1acf22a.mp4?t=1773956264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics is more fun with friends.\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/2141e3e954524c33357cbb3102b6b649.poster.avif?t=1773956264\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/2141e3e954524c33357cbb3102b6b649.webm?t=1773956264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/2141e3e954524c33357cbb3102b6b649.mp4?t=1773956264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modding Platform for Endless Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Sandbox was built with mods in mind from day 1. Our Reality SDK enables the most creatively talented modders to build anything they can dream of, giving players endless content!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/18bb8fc381450e1bc91bcd0aa104dfd2.poster.avif?t=1773956264\" width=614 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/18bb8fc381450e1bc91bcd0aa104dfd2.webm?t=1773956264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/18bb8fc381450e1bc91bcd0aa104dfd2.mp4?t=1773956264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Starter Experiences</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Sandbox comes with three starter experiences using our Reality SDK: A Competitive Shooter, Zombie Horde Mode and a Sandbox. And that\u2019s just 1% of the experience thanks to all the mods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385970/extras/3d476c2b1670f7ddcb886b71d563554a.poster.avif?t=1773956264\" width=614 height=202 